      `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the requirement or obligation the question is about leave the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation unreduced? Answer no if you do not know.
      `a relevant competent authority has made a reasoned request to the importer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that a relevant competent authority has made a reasoned request to the importer?
      `the importer has provided all the necessary information and documentation, including that referred to in paragraph 5, to demonstrate the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you provided all the necessary information and documentation, including that referred to in paragraph 5, to demonstrate the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2?
      `the information and documentation is in a language which can be easily understood by the authorities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the information and documentation is in a language which can be easily understood by the authorities?
